#: mainwindow.cpp:737
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>%1</b><p>When private browsing is turned on, web pages are not added to "
"the history, new cookies are not stored, current cookies cannot be accessed, "
"site icons will not be stored, the session will not be saved. Until you "
"close the window, you can still click the Back and Forward buttons to return "
"to the web pages you have opened.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>%1</b><p>Is \"schuult nettkieken\" anmaakt, warrt de Vörgeschicht keen "
"Nettsieden toföögt, keen nieg Kookjes wohrt, Togriep op al vörhannen Kookjes "
"warrt verhöödt, de Nettsieden-Lüttbiller un de Törn warrt nich sekert. Bet "
"dat Kiekerfinster tomaakt warrt, laat sik de al opropen Nettsieden mit de "
"Vörut- un Torüch-Knööp anstüern.</p>"

